# AttributeTypeCatalog: named query of the GovernanceRules accelerator. Returns every business attribute type (no parameter): its code (for example EMAIL, PHONE, COUNTRY_CODE, NDC, NPI), name, description, format pattern...
_package: GovernanceRules.named_queries
_type: NamedQuery
_name: AttributeTypeCatalog
active: true
description: 'Returns every business attribute type (no parameter): its code (for example EMAIL, PHONE, COUNTRY_CODE, NDC, NPI), name, description,
  format pattern (regular expression), example, default data classification (code, name, sensitivity rank from 1 public to 5 special category)
  and reference standard (regulation or standard code and name, for example ISO-3166-1). Sorted by code.


  AI agent instructions: Call it first when you design or change a data product: match each attribute you add or change to an attribute type code
  and take its default classification, then call RuleChecklist once with the data domain and these codes (or ApplicableRules for one attribute
  type, with full statements and citations). Use FormatPattern for validations and ReferenceStandard for reference entities. When no attribute
  type fits, say so and query RuleChecklist with the domain and classification only.'
defaultLimit: 500
rootQueryObject: GovernanceRules.named_queries.AttributeTypeCatalog.AttributeType
sort: Code
queryObjects:
- _type: QueryObject
  _name: AttributeType
  entity: GovernanceRules.entities.BusinessAttributeType.BusinessAttributeType
  description: Attribute type with its default classification and reference standard.
  objectProperties:
  - _type: ObjectProperty
    _name: Code
    type: VALUE
    semQlExpression: Code
  - _type: ObjectProperty
    _name: Name
    type: VALUE
    semQlExpression: Name
  - _type: ObjectProperty
    _name: Description
    type: VALUE
    semQlExpression: Description
  - _type: ObjectProperty
    _name: FormatPattern
    type: VALUE
    semQlExpression: FormatPattern
  - _type: ObjectProperty
    _name: Example
    type: VALUE
    semQlExpression: Example
  - _type: ObjectProperty
    _name: DefaultClassificationCode
    type: VALUE
    semQlExpression: DefaultClassification.Code
  - _type: ObjectProperty
    _name: DefaultClassificationName
    type: VALUE
    semQlExpression: DefaultClassification.Name
  - _type: ObjectProperty
    _name: SensitivityRank
    type: VALUE
    semQlExpression: DefaultClassification.SensitivityRank
  - _type: ObjectProperty
    _name: ReferenceStandardCode
    type: VALUE
    semQlExpression: ReferenceStandard.Code
  - _type: ObjectProperty
    _name: ReferenceStandardName
    type: VALUE
    semQlExpression: ReferenceStandard.Name
